sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Dashboard
    participant API as Backend
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant BMS as BMS-001 (simulated)
    UI->>API: POST /api/vehicles/AUTO-001/faults {BatteryOverheat}
    API->>GW: MQTT simulation/AUTO-001/faults
    GW->>BMS: plant: battery cooling failure
    loop every 100 ms
        BMS-->>GW: CAN 0x300 BMS_Status (temperature rising)
    end
    GW->>API: MQTT alerts (battery-temperature Warning → Critical)
    BMS->>BMS: monitor > 60 °C → P0A7E pending → confirmed + freeze frame
    GW->>BMS: UDS 19 02 FF (periodic DTC poll)
    BMS-->>GW: 59 02 FF 0A 7E 00 2F
    GW->>API: MQTT dtcs (P0A7E active)
    API->>API: health = Critical, backend alert
    API-->>UI: SignalR Alert, DtcsChanged, VehicleUpdated
